// # Hostile IDENT fourth println
//
// Logline: Print three strings then IDENT x so emit-wasm must miss a four-string fold.
//
// Setup: One public main. Fourth print is IDENT, not STRING.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Let x be fold-me.
//   2. Print line-a, line-b, line-c, then x.
//   3. A fold-me-only or invented four-string join is a lie.

